's deny-leg topology — for CapWrite actions the support principal is NOT a valid deny vector because support's CapRead-only deny would surface in environments_clone_policy_test.go (BE-0165), not here. Forward-applicable to every POST-{action}-{resource} contract closer (clone, restore, cancel, restart, run, rotate, preview): pick a unique package-level secret constant, build a HandlerForWithLogger that threads logger into NewHandler's penultimate slot, define a canonical happy-path row + canonical body constant (both package-uniquely named), and 3 tests structurally identical to the DELETE contract closer with body-bearing-request adaptations (the body is unchanged across success and deny legs because the body is not the rejection cause).
