+  - The on-call dashboard artifact is a documentation/static-release-gate story like BE-0419 and BE-0420, but it should explicitly bind to both `GET /dashboards/control-plane.json` and `GET /metrics`.
+  - Dashboard credentials should be documented as least-privilege and read-only; tenant, principal, resource, service, and job IDs remain incident join hints, not labels.
+  - Exact static-test substrings should avoid Markdown wrapping surprises when they pin operator-facing contract sentences.
+---
